@@ -2,29 +2,26 @@
 Main plugin object at the highest level.
 
 Contains ida_idaapi.plugin_t and environment variable information.
-Will contain auto_inst_hooks if they are available
+Will contain auto_inst_hooks if they are available.
+
+Top-level imports here are kept minimal so that `from idamagic.core.*`
+works in plain CPython for unit tests (the SDK imports are not
+available outside IDA). All heavy imports happen lazily inside
+``magic.init()`` and ``magic.run()``.
 """
 
